      "assignees": [],
      "body": "## Summary\n\nPrepare the v0.91.7 WP-21A next-milestone closeout planning packet for the next milestone docs. This issue carries the separate closeout-planning role that v0.91.7 WP-21 explicitly deferred out of #4648 after the feature-list/TBD and v0.92 planning-truth alignment was superseded by current v0.91.8 planning authority.\n\n## Goal\n\nCreate a review-ready next-milestone docs closeout plan that names the current v0.91.8/v0.92 planning authority, required carry-forward truth, blockers, non-claims, and handoff gates before WP-22 next-milestone review runs.\n\n## Required Outcome\n\nA retained v0.91.7 WP-21A closeout-planning packet exists and is integrated into the v0.91.7 release-tail sequence so WP-22 can review current next-milestone docs without consuming stale #4648 planning claims.\n\n## Deliverables\n\n- v0.92/v0.91.8 next-milestone docs closeout-planning packet.\n- Handoff map from v0.91.7 reviewed truth into current next-milestone docs.\n- Explicit blocker, supersession, and non-claim register for stale #4648-era planning assumptions.\n- Updated v0.91.7 review/register references if needed so WP-22 depends on WP-21A truth.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- WP-21A is distinct from closed #4648 and does not reopen #4648 scope.\n- The packet identifies current next-milestone planning authority and stale/superseded inputs.\n- WP-22 has a concrete review input for next-milestone docs.\n- The work does not claim v0.91.7 release readiness or v0.92 activation readiness.\n- Lifecycle SRP/SOR records exact validation and residual risk truth.\n\n## Repo Inputs\n\n- docs/milestones/v0.91.7/WP_ISSUE_WAVE_v0.91.7.yaml\n- docs/milestones/v0.91.7/WBS_v0.91.7.md\n- docs/milestones/v0.91.7/review/V0917_SPRINT_REVIEW_REGISTER.md\n- docs/reviews/v0.91.7/remaining-sprints-5403/WP21_REVIEW_4648.md\n- docs/milestones/v0.91.8/\n- docs/milestones/v0.92/\n\n## Non-goals\n\n- Do not rerun WP-21 #4648.\n- Do not execute WP-22 next-milestone review.\n- Do not execute WP-23 release ceremony.\n- Do not claim activation/release readiness from planning alone.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Focused docs/link/placeholder validation for touched planning docs.\n- YAML parse for touched issue-wave files.\n- git diff --check for touched files.\n- Live issue truth check confirming #4648 remains closed and WP-21A is the active closeout-planning input.\n",
